Draw Color: AI Generation is an app for drawing and sketching on your phone with built-in AI.

It is suitable for both sketching and quick notes as well as artistic drawings.

This extremely handy drawing app on your phone for quick sketches provides many useful features such as undo/redo, change the background color or use the image as a background.

- Suitable for professionals and beginners alike;
- Many tools to create a masterpiece: pencil, pen, crayons, watercolor, fill, roller, etc;
- Ability to change the size of the brush and transparency - for fans of drawing art;
- AI generates interesting pictures for coloring or for inspiration;
- Drawing application with support for multiple layers;
- Drawing program with a full palette and the ability to create custom colors.
